      },
      {
        "h": "4. Configurations & counter-evidence",
        "body": "Symptom concentrates in configurations with more than two signalling loops. 412 panels on {{fw:EST4@4.1}} at 180 sites show no symptom. Effect persists across certified and uncertified installers (indeterminate below N=15)."
